            <ArticleTitle>A Novel Technique of Intraoperative Lateral Pectoral Nerve Block During Subpectoral Breast Implant Placement.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e646</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/GOX.0000000000000625</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Breast surgery is one of the most frequently performed surgeries in hospitals and can be associated with significant postoperative pain. We report a novel technique of intraoperative lateral pectoral nerve block under direct vision for analgesia post subpectoral implant placement for breast reconstruction.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
